{
  "id": "gradient-descent-and-learning-rate",
  "title": "梯度下降与学习率",
  "subtitle": "从下山直觉到优化引擎",
  "language": "zh-CN",
  "audience": "机器学习初学者与算法工程师",
  "theme": "lab",
  "tutor": {
    "suggestions": [
      "为什么梯度指向上升方向，我们却要顺着负梯度走？",
      "在峡谷地形中，把学习率设得足够小能解决震荡吗？",
      "既然 Adam 能自适应调整学习率，为什么初始学习率设错还是会崩？",
      "高维空间中为什么鞍点比局部极小值更普遍？"
    ],
    "kb": [
      {
        "pattern": "梯度|gradient",
        "answer": "损失函数在某点的一阶导数（向量），指向该点处**上升最快**的方向。负梯度即最陡下降方向。"
      },
      {
        "pattern": "学习率|learning rate|步长",
        "answer": "控制每次参数更新步幅的超参数 $\\eta$。并非绝对距离，而是梯度模长的缩放因子。"
      },
      {
        "pattern": "Lipschitz 连续|Hessian|学习率上界",
        "answer": "保证梯度下降收敛的理论约束：$\\eta < 2/\\lambda_{max}$，其中 $\\lambda_{max}$ 为 Hessian 矩阵最大特征值。"
      },
      {
        "pattern": "鞍点|saddle point",
        "answer": "梯度为 0 但 Hessian 矩阵特征值有正有负的驻点，在高位空间中远比局部极小值常见。"
      },
      {
        "pattern": "病态曲率|峡谷|之字形",
        "answer": "损失曲面在不同维度曲率差异极大，导致梯度下降在陡峭维震荡、在平缓维停滞，需动量法缓解。"
      }
    ]
  },
  "scenes": [
    {
      "id": "cover",
      "kind": "hero",
      "notes": "梯度下降的本质是“蒙眼下山”的直觉，而学习率决定了你每一步迈多大，千万别误以为步子越大收敛越快，步子太大反而容易跨过谷底甚至发散。为了真正理解这个下山过程，我们下一页先来看看我们要下的这座“山”——损失地形——到底长什么样。",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "hero",
          "title": [
            "梯度下降与学习率",
            "从下山直觉到优化引擎"
          ],
          "tag": "优化方法 · 第一讲",
          "sub": "在 $L(w)=\\frac{1}{2}(w-3)^2$ 上，学习率 $\\eta=0.1$ 时约 50 步收敛，$\\eta=2.1$ 时则发散到无穷。",
          "facts": "学习率是深度学习中最重要却最难调的超参数之一——Yoshua Bengio, 2012",
          "hint": "本讲从一维抛物线最小化出发，建立对步长与收敛的直觉。",
          "id": "b_cover"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "intuition-terrain",
      "kind": "content",
      "eyebrow": "直觉建立",
      "headline": "损失地形与最陡下降",
      "lead": "梯度的物理意义是坡度，负梯度指向最陡的下山方向。",
      "notes": "想象你蒙着眼睛站在这个损失地形上，梯度并不指向全局最低点，它只告诉你脚下最陡的上升方向，所以必须向负梯度方向走才能最速下山。同学们常误以为顺着梯度就能直达终点，却忽略了局部极小值和鞍点的陷阱；既然知道了下山方向，那每一步究竟该迈多大？这就引出了下一页关于学习率如何控制参数更新步长的核心问题。",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "diagram",
          "diagramType": "connected-circles",
          "nodes": [
            {
              "title": "等高线 $L(\\mathbf{w})=c$",
              "sub": "同心圆，如 $c=4,\\;1,\\;0.25$"
            },
            {
              "title": "梯度 $\\nabla L$",
              "sub": "处处正交于等高线，指向 $L$ 增大方向"
            },
            {
              "title": "负梯度 $-\\nabla L$",
              "sub": "指向圆心 $\\mathbf{w}^*$，即最陡下降方向"
            },
            {
              "title": "学习率 $\\eta$",
              "sub": "步长系数，如 $\\eta=0.1$"
            },
            {
              "title": "更新 $\\mathbf{w}_{t+1}=\\mathbf{w}_t-\\eta\\nabla L$",
              "sub": "$(2,3)\\to(1.6,2.4)$，向圆心靠近"
            }
          ],
          "id": "b_terrain"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "label": "辨析",
          "text": "梯度 $\\nabla L$ 指向损失上升最陡方向，取负才是下山方向；学习率 $\\eta$ 缩放的是梯度向量，而非直接决定移动的绝对距离。",
          "id": "b_why_neg"
        }
      ],
      "layout": {
        "kind": "compose",
        "preset": "sidenote"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "lr-and-update",
      "kind": "content",
      "eyebrow": "核心机制",
      "headline": "参数更新与学习率效应",
      "lead": "新位置 = 原位置 - 学习率 × 梯度，学习率的大小直接决定收敛的命运。",
      "transition": "zoom",
      "notes": "承接上页找到的最陡方向，本页核心在于“迈出多大步”，即学习率 η 的缩放效应；同学们常误以为梯度绝对值决定了步长，其实梯度只定方向，步幅由 η 全权掌控。右侧模拟直观展示了 η 过大导致越过谷底甚至发散、过小则停滞不前的困境。究竟多大的步长才能保证收敛？我们下一页将通过一阶泰勒展开从数学上给出严格的上界证明。",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "formula",
          "latex": "\\theta_{t+1} = \\theta_t - \\eta \\nabla L(\\theta_t)",
          "caption": "参数沿梯度反方向更新。以 $L(\\theta) = \\theta^2$ 为例：在 $\\theta_t = 3$ 处梯度为 $6$；若 $\\eta = 0.1$，则 $\\theta_{t+1} = 3 - 0.1 \\times 6 = 2.4$（稳步逼近谷底）；若 $\\eta = 1$，则 $\\theta_{t+1} = -3$（越过极小值发生震荡）。",
          "id": "b_update_formula"
        },
        {
          "type": "sim",
          "engine": "widget",
          "html": "<style>\n  .widget {\n    background: var(--bg2);\n    border-radius: var(--radius, 12px);\n    padding: 20px;\n    color: var(--ink);\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    height: 100%;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    font-family: var(--sans);\n  }\n  svg#stage {\n    width: 100%;\n    flex: 1;\n    min-height: 0;\n    cursor: crosshair;\n    background: var(--card);\n    border-radius: var(--radius, 8px);\n  }\n  .controls {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 12px;\n    margin-top: 16px;\n  }\n  label {\n    font-size: 12px;\n    letter-spacing: .08em;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    color: var(--text2);\n  }\n  input[type=range] {\n    flex: 1;\n    accent-color: var(--accent);\n  }\n  .val {\n    font-family: var(--mono);\n    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    color: var(--accent);\n    min-width: 36px;\n    text-align: right;\n  }\n  button {\n    background: var(--card);\n    border: 1px solid var(--line);\n    color: var(--ink);\n    padding: 6px 16px;\n    border-radius: var(--radius, 6px);\n    cursor: pointer;\n    font-family: var(--sans);\n    font-size: 13px;\n    transition: all 120ms linear;\n  }\n  button:hover {\n    background: var(--accent);\n    color: var(--bg);\n    border-color: var(--accent);\n  }\n  button:active {\n    transform: scale(0.95);\n  }\n</style>\n<div class=\"widget\">\n  <svg id=\"stage\" viewBox=\"0 0 680 360\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid meet\">\n    <defs>\n      <filter id=\"glow\">\n        <feGaussianBlur stdDeviation=\"3\" result=\"coloredBlur\"/>\n        <feMerge>\n          <feMergeNode in=\"coloredBlur\"/>\n          <feMergeNode in=\"SourceGraphic\"/>\n        </feMerge>\n      </filter>\n      <marker id=\"arrowhead\" markerWidth=\"8\" markerHeight=\"6\" refX=\"8\" refY=\"3\" orient=\"auto\">\n        <polygon points=\"0 0, 8 3, 0 6\" fill=\"var(--accent)\" />\n      </marker>\n    </defs>\n    <g id=\"ticks\"></g>\n    <path id=\"curve\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--line)\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\" />\n    <line id=\"crossX\" stroke=\"var(--line)\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 4\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\" />\n    <line id=\"crossY\" stroke=\"var(--line)\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 4\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\" />\n    <path id=\"trail\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"var(--accent)\" stroke-width=\"2\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\" filter=\"url(#glow)\" />\n    <line id=\"gradArrow\" stroke=\"var(--accent)\" stroke-width=\"2\" marker-end=\"url(#arrowhead)\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\" />\n    <circle id=\"ball\" r=\"6\" fill=\"var(--accent)\" filter=\"url(#glow)\" />\n    <text x=\"16\" y=\"24\" font-family=\"var(--mono)\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"var(--text2)\">\n      step <tspan id=\"stepLabel\" fill=\"var(--ink)\">3</tspan>\n      <tspan dx=\"12\">lr </tspan><tspan id=\"lrLabel\" fill=\"var(--ink)\">0.30</tspan>\n      <tspan dx=\"12\">loss </tspan><tspan id=\"lossLabel\" fill=\"var(--ink)\">0.72</tspan>\n    </text>\n    <text id=\"statusLabel\" x=\"664\" y=\"24\" text-anchor=\"end\" font-family=\"var(--mono)\" font-size=\"11\" fill=\"var(--accent)\">收敛中</text>\n  </svg>\n  <div class=\"controls\">\n    <label for=\"lr\">学习率</label>\n    <input type=\"range\" id=\"lr\" min=\"0.01\" max=\"2.0\" step=\"0.01\" value=\"0.3\">\n    <span class=\"val\" id=\"lrReadout\">0.30</span>\n    <button id=\"playpause\">暂停</button>\n    <button id=\"reset\">重置</button>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<script>\n  const stage = document.getElementById('stage');\n  const curve = document.getElementById('curve');\n  const trail = document.getElementById('trail');\n  const gradArrow = document.getElementById('gradArrow');\n  const ball = document.getElementById('ball');\n  const crossX = document.getElementById('crossX');\n  const crossY = document.getElementById('crossY');\n  const stepLabel = document.getElementById('stepLabel');\n  const lrLabel = document.getElementById('lrLabel');\n  const lossLabel = document.getElementById('lossLabel');\n  const statusLabel = document.getElementById('statusLabel');\n  const lrSlider = document.getElementById('lr');\n  const lrReadout = document.getElementById('lrReadout');\n  const playpause = document.getElementById('playpause');\n  const resetBtn = document.getElementById('reset');\n  const ticksGroup = document.getElementById('ticks');\n\n  const loss = x => 0.5 * (x - 3) * (x - 3);\n  const sx = x => 40 + x * 100;\n  const sy = y => 320 - y * 60;\n\n  const state = {\n    lr: 0.3,\n    x: 4.2,\n    step: 3,\n    path: [{x:5.5, y:loss(5.5)}, {x:4.8, y:loss(4.8)}, {x:4.2, y:loss(4.2)}],\n    running: true\n  };\n\n  function init() {\n    let d = `M ${sx(0)} ${sy(loss(0))}`;\n    for (let i = 1; i <= 60; i++) {\n      const xi = 6 * i / 60;\n      d += ` L ${sx(xi)} ${sy(loss(xi))}`;\n    }\n    curve.setAttribute('d', d);\n\n    let ticksHTML = '';\n    for (let i = 0; i <= 6; i++) {\n      const x = sx(i);\n      ticksHTML += `<line x1=\"${x}\" y1=\"320\" x2=\"${x}\" y2=\"326\" stroke=\"var(--line)\" stroke-width=\"1\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"/>`;\n      if (i > 0 && i < 6) {\n        ticksHTML += `<text x=\"${x}\" y=\"342\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"var(--text2)\" font-size=\"10\" font-family=\"var(--mono)\">${i}</text>`;\n      }\n    }\n    for (let i = 0; i <= 4; i++) {\n      const y = sy(i);\n      ticksHTML += `<line x1=\"34\" y1=\"${y}\" x2=\"40\" y2=\"${y}\" stroke=\"var(--line)\" stroke-width=\"1\" vector-effect=\"non-scaling-stroke\"/>`;\n      if (i > 0) {\n        ticksHTML += `<text x=\"30\" y=\"${y + 4}\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"var(--text2)\" font-size=\"10\" font-family=\"var(--mono)\">${i}</text>`;\n      }\n    }\n    ticksGroup.innerHTML = ticksHTML;\n\n    update();\n  }\n\n  function update() {\n    const x = state.x;\n    const y = loss(x);\n    const grad = x - 3;\n\n    ball.setAttribute('cx', sx(x));\n    ball.setAttribute('cy', sy(y));\n\n    let d = `M ${sx(state.path[0].x)} ${sy(state.path[0].y)}`;\n    for (let i = 1; i < state.path.length; i++) {\n      d += ` L ${sx(state.path[i].x)} ${sy(state.path[i].y)}`;\n    }\n    trail.setAttribute('d', d);\n\n    const nextX = x - state.lr * grad;\n    const nextY = loss(nextX);\n    gradArrow.setAttribute('x1', sx(x));\n    gradArrow.setAttribute('y1', sy(y));\n    gradArrow.setAttribute('x2', sx(nextX));\n    gradArrow.setAttribute('y2', sy(nextY));\n\n    crossX.setAttribute('x1', 40);\n    crossX.setAttribute('x2', sx(x));\n    crossX.setAttribute('y1', sy(y));\n    crossX.setAttribute('y2', sy(y));\n\n    crossY.setAttribute('x1', sx(x));\n    crossY.setAttribute('x2', sx(x));\n    crossY.setAttribute('y1', sy(y));\n    crossY.setAttribute('y2', 320);\n\n    stepLabel.textContent = state.step;\n    lrLabel.textContent = state.lr.toFixed(2);\n    lossLabel.textContent = y.toFixed(2);\n\n    let status = '收敛中';\n    if (state.path.length >= 2) {\n      const last = state.path[state.path.length - 1];\n      const prev = state.path[state.path.length - 2];\n      if ((last.x - 3) * (prev.x - 3) < 0) {\n        status = '震荡';\n      }\n      if (last.y > prev.y + 0.01) {\n        status = '发散';\n      }\n    }\n    if (x < 0 || x > 6) status = '发散';\n    statusLabel.textContent = status;\n  }\n\n  function step() {\n    if (state.x < 0 || state.x > 6) {\n      state.running = false;\n      playpause.textContent = '播放';\n      return;\n    }\n    if (state.step >= 120) {\n      state.running = false;\n      playpause.textContent = '播放';\n      return;\n    }\n\n    const grad = state.x - 3;\n    const nextX = state.x - state.lr * grad;\n    const nextY = loss(nextX);\n\n    state.x = nextX;\n    state.step++;\n    state.path.push({ x: nextX, y: nextY });\n\n    update();\n  }\n\n  lrSlider.addEventListener('input', e => {\n    state.lr = parseFloat(e.target.value);\n    lrReadout.textContent = state.lr.toFixed(2);\n    update();\n  });\n\n  resetBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n    state.x = 5.5;\n    state.step = 0;\n    state.path = [{ x: 5.5, y: loss(5.5) }];\n    state.running = true;\n    playpause.textContent = '暂停';\n    update();\n  });\n\n  playpause.addEventListener('click', () => {\n    state.running = !state.running;\n    playpause.textContent = state.running ? '暂停' : '播放';\n  });\n\n  stage.addEventListener('click', e => {\n    const rect = stage.getBoundingClientRect();\n    const svgX = (e.clientX - rect.left) / rect.width * 680;\n    const dataX = (svgX - 40) / 100;\n    if (dataX < 0 || dataX > 6) return;\n    const clampedX = Math.max(0.1, Math.min(5.9, dataX));\n    state.x = clampedX;\n    state.step = 0;\n    state.path = [{ x: clampedX, y: loss(clampedX) }];\n    state.running = true;\n    playpause.textContent = '暂停';\n    update();\n  });\n\n  let lastTime = 0;\n  function animate(time) {\n    if (state.running) {\n      if (time - lastTime > 400) {\n        step();\n        lastTime = time;\n      }\n    } else {\n      lastTime = time;\n    }\n    requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n  }\n\n  init();\n  requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n</script>",
          "id": "b_lr_sim"
        }
      ],
      "layout": {
        "kind": "split",
        "anchor": [
          "b_update_formula"
        ],
        "ratio": 0.4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "theory-constraint",
      "kind": "content",
      "eyebrow": "理论约束",
      "headline": "一阶泰勒展开与收敛上界",
      "lead": "梯度下降的局部最优性源于一阶近似，学习率存在严格的理论上限。",
      "notes": "承接上一页对学习率效应的直观感受，本页通过一阶泰勒展开将局部曲面近似为直线，从而严格推导出保证损失下降的学习率上界。同学们常误以为该展开是全局精确的，但超过上界意味着步长跨出了局部近似的有效区域，必然导致发散；而即便学习率满足此上界，面对复杂的非凸地形依然不够，下一页我们将探讨峡谷震荡与鞍点陷阱。",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "formula",
          "latex": "L(\\theta + \\Delta\\theta) \\approx L(\\theta) + \\nabla L(\\theta)^\\top \\Delta\\theta",
          "caption": "损失函数在参数 $\\theta$ 处的一阶泰勒近似，揭示了梯度 $\\nabla L(\\theta)$ 与步长 $\\Delta\\theta$ 对损失变化的线性贡献",
          "id": "b_taylor"
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "items": [
            {
              "lead": "一阶泰勒上界",
              "text": "$f(x+\\eta d) \\leq f(x) + \\eta \\nabla f(x)^T d + \\frac{L\\eta^2}{2}\\|d\\|^2$，其中 $L$ 为梯度 Lipschitz 常数。右端是 $d$ 的二次上界，最小化它即得下降方向。",
              "fragment": "fade-up",
              "icon": "trending-down"
            },
            {
              "lead": "负梯度最优",
              "text": "由 Cauchy–Schwarz 不等式 $\\nabla f(x)^T d \\geq -\\|\\nabla f(x)\\|\\cdot\\|d\\|$，等号当 $d \\propto -\\nabla f(x)$ 成立，故单位下降最快方向为 $d^* = -\\nabla f(x)/\\|\\nabla f(x)\\|$。",
              "fragment": "fade-up",
              "icon": "trending-down"
            },
            {
              "lead": "最优步长",
              "text": "代入 $d=-\\nabla f(x)$ 后对 $\\eta$ 求极小，得 $\\eta^*=1/L$，单步保证 $f(x_{k+1}) \\leq f(x_k) - \\frac{1}{2L}\\|\\nabla f(x_k)\\|^2$。",
              "fragment": "fade-up",
              "icon": "check"
            },
            {
              "lead": "学习率上界",
              "text": "对二次 $f(x)=\\frac{1}{2}x^T\\!Ax$，迭代矩阵 $I-\\eta A$ 谱半径 $<1$ 要求 $\\eta < 2/\\lambda_{max}$。例：$A=\\mathrm{diag}(1,100)$ 时 $\\eta<0.02$，取 $\\eta=0.03$ 即发散。",
              "icon": "check"
            },
            {
              "lead": "凸收敛率",
              "text": "凸函数下 $f(x_k)-f^* \\leq \\frac{\\|x_0-x^*\\|^2}{2\\eta k}$，即 $O(1/k)$ 亚线性收敛。",
              "icon": "trending-down"
            },
            {
              "lead": "强凸收敛率",
              "text": "$\\mu$-强凸时 $f(x_k)-f^* \\leq (1-\\eta\\mu)^k[f(x_0)-f^*]$，取 $\\eta=1/L$ 得 $O((1-\\mu/L)^k)$ 线性收敛。",
              "icon": "clock"
            }
          ],
          "id": "b_lr_upper_bound"
        },
        {
          "type": "callout",
          "label": "理论≠实际",
          "text": "收敛上界 $\\rho < 1$ 仅对一阶泰勒近似 $L(x)$ 成立，截断误差会导致真实损失 $f(x)$ 在步长 $\\eta$ 偏大时反而上升。",
          "id": "b_approx_error"
        }
      ],
      "layout": {
        "kind": "index",
        "steps": [
          {
            "label": "一阶泰勒展开",
            "blockIds": [
              "b_taylor"
            ]
          },
          {
            "label": "推导负梯度最优性",
            "blockIds": [
              "b_lr_upper_bound"
            ]
          },
          {
            "label": "误区",
            "blockIds": [
              "b_approx_error"
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "pathology-saddle",
      "kind": "content",
      "eyebrow": "反直觉现象",
      "headline": "峡谷震荡与鞍点陷阱",
      "lead": "真实损失地形并非完美碗状，病态曲率与高维鞍点才是常态。",
      "notes": "上一页的收敛上界揭示了曲率不一致时的困境，这具体表现为本页的“峡谷震荡”（梯度在陡壁间横跳而非沿谷底前进）和“鞍点陷阱”（梯度近乎为零导致停滞）。大家常误以为鞍点就是局部极小值，其实它只是某些维度的平缓区；正是这两种一阶法难以逾越的痛点，直接催生了下一页对自适应学习率算法的需求。",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "diagram",
          "diagramType": "snake",
          "nodes": [
